# Everything in this directory is BUILT, not hand-placed.
#
#   node scripts/build-images.mjs
#
# That script is the single source of truth for what lands here and where each
# source comes from. Don't drop files in by hand or edit the outputs — they get
# overwritten on the next run. To change an image, change the script.
#
# See the "Images" section of AGENTS.md for the per-file recipe.
